{
  "slug": "gemini",
  "name": "Gemini",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Use Gemini CLI from Claude Code to review code, analyze codebases, or delegate tasks. Leverages Gemini's 1M token context window for whole-codebase analysis.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**, **1 agent**, **9 commands** and **3 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `gemini-cli-runtime` (Internal contract for calling gemini-companion runtime from Claude Code), `gemini-prompting` (Internal guidance for composing Gemini prompts for coding, review, diagnosis, and research tasks), `gemini-result-handling` (Internal guidance for presenting Gemini output back to the user), `guide` (Quick reference for Gemini plugin commands, model aliases, effort levels, and review gate configuration)\n- **Agents** (1): `gemini-consult` (Proactively use when Claude Code wants a second implementation or diagnosis pass, needs a deeper root-cause investigation, or…)\n- **Commands** (9): `analyze` (Run a whole-codebase Gemini analysis), `cancel` (Cancel a running Gemini background job), `challenge` (Run a Gemini challenge review — maximum skepticism, challenges assumptions), `consult` (Consult Gemini CLI on a task), `guide` (Quick reference for all Gemini plugin commands, model aliases, effort levels, and review gate configuration), `result` (Get the output of a completed Gemini background job), `review` (Run a Gemini code review on your current changes), `setup` (Check Gemini CLI installation, authentication status, and manage the review gate), and 1 more\n- **Hooks** (3): `SessionStart`, `SessionEnd`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install gemini@claude-community` from `arescope/gemini-plugin-cc`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
